# Striatum Claude Code Plugin (v{striatum_version})

This bundle was generated by `striatum plugin install --profile claude_code`.

## Install

From the directory containing this plugin (project scope):

```
/plugin install ./.striatum/plugins/claude_code
```

Or, with the marketplace fixture:

```
/plugin marketplace add ./.striatum/plugins/
/plugin install striatum@local-striatum
```

User-scope: pass `--scope user` at generation time to write under
`~/.claude/plugins/striatum/` instead.

## Layout

- `.claude-plugin/plugin.json` — Claude Code plugin manifest
- `skills/striatum-*/SKILL.md` — six skills (workflow, scaffold,
  claim-loop, supervise, recover, mcp)
- `commands/*.md` — five slash commands (`claim-next`, `status`,
  `why`, `dashboard`, `doctor`)
- `hooks/hooks.json` — empty hooks (commented stubs)
- `.mcp.json` — empty MCP server placeholder
- `.manifest.json` — Striatum-side regeneration manifest

## Regenerate

```
striatum plugin install --profile claude_code [--force]
```

`--force` overwrites operator edits; without it, edited files are
preserved.
